# Exam track — Theme: Medien & Technologie — Sub-lesson 3: Talking About It
# @question sentences: the examiner asks in Luxembourgish, the learner
# assembles the Luxembourgish answer (always en→lu).
#
# These are the user's real answers, gathered by interview — do not "improve"
# or genericize them in a later editing pass. The point is that the learner
# rehearses what they will actually say in the Sproochentest.
#
# The @fill blocks carry frames that recur across any topic: well-causal,
# wann-conditional, obwuel-contrast, léiwer-wéi comparative, fir…ze purpose,
# dofir inversion, wärenddeems-temporal, a number, a duration, a frequency
# adverb, a past participle, and an Ech-mengen hedge.

@lesson D1.03 "Talking About Media"

@word d'Kand = the child
@word d'Zukunft = the future
@word d'Reputatioun = the reputation
@word d'Ligen = the lie
@word d'Batterie = the battery
@word den Toun = the sound
@word de Kont = the account
@word d'Passwuert = the password
@word de Kopfhörer = the headphones
@word d'Notifikatioun = the notification
@word de Journalist = the journalist
@word de Regisseur = the film director
@word de Fuerscher = the researcher
@word d'Sektioun = the section
@word de Kommentar = the comment
@word d'Videospill = the video game
@word de Radiosender = the radio station
@word de Cours = the course
@word de Fotoapparat = the camera
@word d'Gespréich = the conversation
@word d'Opmierksamkeet = the attention
@word eroflueden = to download
@word eroplueden = to upload
@word läschen = to delete
@word kréien = to get
@word changéieren = to change
@word umaachen = to switch on
@word ausmaachen = to switch off
@word oflenken = to distract
@word gleewen = to believe
@word kontrolléieren = to check
@word auswielen = to select
@word opwuessen = to grow up
@word poteren = to chat
@word beäntweren = to answer
@word erwuessen = adult
@word séier = fast
@word roueg = quiet
@word modern = modern
@word reegelméisseg = regularly
@word auswenneg = by heart

@sentence
@question Wat heescht fir Iech Technologie? Firwat hutt Dir dat Theema gewielt?
@lu Technologie ass haut en Deel vum Liewen, an ech hunn dat Theema gewielt, well ech domat schaffen.
@distractor-lu Kandheet
@distractor-lu langweileg
@en Technology is a part of life today, and I chose this topic because I work with it.
@distractor-en childhood
@distractor-en boring

@sentence
@question Wéi eng Medie benotzt Dir, fir Iech iwwer d'Aktualitéit ze informéieren?
@lu Ech informéiere mech um Internet, virun allem op Twitter an op Telegram.
@distractor-lu Radio
@distractor-lu Zeitung
@en I inform myself on the internet, above all on Twitter and on Telegram.
@distractor-en radio
@distractor-en newspaper

@sentence
@question Wat fir Sektiounen interesséieren Iech an der Aktualitéit?
@lu Mech interesséieren Technologie, Politik, Europa, Lëtzebuerg an d'Ukrain.
@distractor-lu Sport
@distractor-lu Reklamm
@en Technology, politics, Europe, Luxembourg and Ukraine interest me.
@distractor-en sport
@distractor-en advertisement

@sentence
@question Firwat liest Dir all Moien d'Noriichten aus der Ukrain?
@lu Ech liese se all Moien, well meng Eltere a meng Frënn do wunnen.
@distractor-lu owes
@distractor-lu seelen
@en I read them every morning, because my parents and my friends live there.
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-en rarely

@sentence
@question Wat fir Medie benotzt Dir reegelméisseg?
@lu Ech benotze reegelméisseg den Handy, de Laptop an d'Tëlee.
@distractor-lu Zeitung
@distractor-lu Radio
@en I regularly use the mobile phone, the laptop and the TV.
@distractor-en newspaper
@distractor-en radio

@sentence
@question Wat fir Applikatioune benotzt Dir all Dag?
@lu All Dag benotzen ech Google Maps, Kindle, Audible, Chrome, Spotify, Telegram a WhatsApp.
@distractor-lu seelen
@distractor-lu Videospill
@en Every day I use Google Maps, Kindle, Audible, Chrome, Spotify, Telegram and WhatsApp.
@distractor-en rarely
@distractor-en game

@sentence
@question Wéini krut Dir Ären éischten Handy?
@lu Ech hunn en am Joer zweedausendvéier kritt, an ech war deemools nonzéng Joer al.
@distractor-lu Laptop
@distractor-lu Fotoapparat
@en I got it in the year two thousand four, and I was nineteen years old then.
@distractor-en laptop
@distractor-en camera

@sentence
@question Wéi oft changéiert Dir den Handy?
@lu Ech benotze mäin iPhone säit véier Joer, an ech changéieren en all fënnef bis aacht Joer.
@distractor-lu Wochen
@distractor-lu Stonnen
@en I have been using my iPhone for four years, and I change it every five to eight years.
@distractor-en weeks
@distractor-en hours

@sentence
@question Wéi wichteg ass den Handy fir Iech, a wat maacht Dir domat?
@lu Den Handy ass wichteg fir mech, well ech domat liesen, Fotoe maachen an telefonéieren.
@distractor-lu onwichteg
@distractor-lu langweileg
@en The mobile phone is important to me, because I read, take photos and phone with it.
@distractor-en unimportant
@distractor-en boring

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir den Handy wärend dem Iessen um Dësch leien? Firwat?
@lu Wann ech eleng iessen, hunn ech den Handy um Dësch, mee mat anere Leit schwätzen ech léiwer.
@distractor-lu Bildschierm
@distractor-lu Kopfhörer
@en When I eat alone, I have the phone on the table, but with other people I prefer talking.
@distractor-en screen
@distractor-en headphones

@sentence
@question Wéini stellt Dir den Handy op roueg?
@lu Mäin Handy ass ëmmer roueg, an ech maachen den Toun just un, wann ech e wichtegen Uruff erwaarden.
@distractor-lu Bildschierm
@distractor-lu Batterie
@en My phone is always silent, and I only switch the sound on when I expect an important call.
@distractor-en screen
@distractor-en battery

@sentence
@question Wéini maacht Dir den Handy aus?
@lu Ech maache mäin Handy ni aus, ausser d'Batterie ass eidel.
@distractor-lu dacks
@distractor-lu Toun
@en I never switch my phone off, unless the battery is empty.
@distractor-en often
@distractor-en sound

@sentence
@question Wéi vill Message schéckt Dir am Dag?
@lu Ech schécken ongeféier fofzeg Message am Dag.
@distractor-lu zéng
@distractor-lu Bréiwer
@en I send about fifty messages a day.
@distractor-en ten
@distractor-en letters

@sentence
@question Wéi vill E-Maile kritt Dir pro Dag?
@lu Ech kréien ongeféier drësseg E-Mailen den Dag, mee ech liese just d'Sujeten a läschen de Rescht.
@distractor-lu Postkaarten
@distractor-lu schreiwen
@en I get about thirty emails a day, but I only read the subjects and delete the rest.
@distractor-en postcards
@distractor-en calls

@sentence
@question Wéi vill Telefonsnummere kennt Dir auswenneg?
@lu Ech kenne just meng Nummer an d'Nummer vu menger Fra.
@distractor-lu Passwuert
@distractor-lu Kont
@en I only know my number and my wife's number.
@distractor-en password
@distractor-en account

@sentence
@question Firwat benotzt Dir den Internet?
@lu Ech benotzen den Internet fir Noriichten, fir Akeef a fir sozial Netzwierker.
@distractor-lu Reklamm
@distractor-lu Radio
@en I use the internet for news, for shopping and for social networks.
@distractor-en advertisement
@distractor-en radio

@sentence
@question Wéi vill Zäit verbréngt Dir den Dag um Internet?
@lu Ech sinn dräi bis véier Stonnen den Dag um Internet, an heiansdo verléieren ech do Zäit.
@distractor-lu Minutten
@distractor-lu Wochen
@en I am on the internet three to four hours a day, and sometimes I lose time there.
@distractor-en minutes
@distractor-en weeks

@sentence
@question Liest Dir gär Bicher? Wat hutt Dir léiwer: en Héierbuch oder e Buch?
@lu Ech liese gär richteg Bicher, mee en Héierbuch ass praktesch, wann ech fueren oder mam Hond spadséieren.
@distractor-lu langweileg
@distractor-lu Zäitschrëft
@en I like reading real books, but an audiobook is practical when I drive or walk with the dog.
@distractor-en boring
@distractor-en magazine

@sentence
@question Wéi ee Buch hutt Dir fir d'lescht gelies?
@lu Fir d'lescht hunn ech Colony vum Max Kidruk gelies, an dat ass Science-Fiction.
@distractor-lu Zeitung
@distractor-lu Kommentar
@en Last I read Colony by Max Kidruk, and that is science fiction.
@distractor-en newspaper
@distractor-en comment

@sentence
@question Schreift Dir heiansdo Bréiwer?
@lu Nee, ech schreiwe keng Bréiwer, mee mir schécke gär Postkaarten un eis Frënn.
@distractor-lu Message
@distractor-lu läschen
@en No, I do not write letters, but we like sending postcards to our friends.
@distractor-en messages
@distractor-en messages

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir e Liblingspodcast? Wa jo, wéi een?
@lu Mäi Liblingspodcast heescht Bromance, an do schwätzen e Journalist an e Regisseur iwwer alles.
@distractor-lu Radiosender
@distractor-lu Sendung
@en My favorite podcast is called Bromance, and there a journalist and a film director talk about everything.
@distractor-en radio
@distractor-en broadcast

@sentence
@question Wéi bleift Dir a Kontakt mat Frënn a Famill?
@lu Mir hunn e Chat mat de Frënn, a mat menger Famill telefonéieren ech all Woch mat Video.
@distractor-lu Bréif
@distractor-lu Reklamm
@en We have a chat with the friends, and with my family I make a video call every week.
@distractor-en letter
@distractor-en advertisement

@sentence
@question Sidd Dir op de sozialen Netzwierker aktiv?
@lu Ech war fréier vill op Facebook, mee elo benotzen ech meeschtens Twitter.
@distractor-lu Radio
@distractor-lu Zeitung
@en In the past I was a lot on Facebook, but now I mostly use Twitter.
@distractor-en radio
@distractor-en newspaper

@sentence
@question Wat haalt Dir vun Instagram?
@lu Instagram gefält mir net esou gutt, well ech léiwer liese wéi Biller kucken.
@distractor-lu lauschteren
@distractor-lu Toun
@en I do not like Instagram that much, because I prefer reading to looking at pictures.
@distractor-en listening
@distractor-en sound

@sentence
@question Benotzt Dir Instagram guer net?
@lu Heiansdo kucken ech do lëschteg Videoe vun Déieren a gutt Fotografie.
@distractor-lu Bréiwer
@distractor-lu Zeitungen
@en Sometimes I look at funny videos of animals and at good photography there.
@distractor-en letters
@distractor-en newspapers

@sentence
@question Kommentéiert Dir online, zum Beispill op Youtube oder Telegram?
@lu Jo, ech schreiwen dacks Kommentaren op Twitter an an Telegram-Gruppen, mee op YouTube seelen.
@distractor-lu Postkaarten
@distractor-lu ëmmer
@en Yes, I often write comments on Twitter and in Telegram groups, but on YouTube rarely.
@distractor-en postcards
@distractor-en always

@sentence
@question Wéi eng YouTube Channelen hutt Dir abonéiert?
@lu Ech hu Veritasium an Alyn Wallace abonéiert, an do geet et ëm Physik a Fotografie.
@distractor-lu Radiosender
@distractor-lu Zäitschrëft
@en I have subscribed to Veritasium and Alyn Wallace, and there it is about physics and photography.
@distractor-en radio
@distractor-en magazine

@sentence
@question Maacht Dir Fotoe mam Handy? Wéi vill?
@lu Jo, ech maache ganz vill Fotoe mam Handy, virun allem vu mengem Hond.
@distractor-lu Videospiller
@distractor-lu Kommentaren
@en Yes, I take very many photos with the phone, above all of my dog.
@distractor-en games
@distractor-en comments

@sentence
@question Wat maacht Dir mat de Fotoen?
@lu Déi schéinste Fotoen deelen ech online, an de Rescht bleift just fir mech.
@distractor-lu läschen
@distractor-lu Passwuert
@en The most beautiful photos I share online, and the rest stays just for me.
@distractor-en deleting
@distractor-en password

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir eng Tëlee? Wat maacht Dir domat?
@lu Jo, mir hunn eng Tëlee, mee mir benotze se fir Streaming, YouTube a Videospiller.
@distractor-lu Noriichten
@distractor-lu Radio
@en Yes, we have a TV, but we use it for streaming, YouTube and video games.
@distractor-en news
@distractor-en radio

@sentence
@question Kuckt Dir léiwer Filmer um Handy oder um Laptop? Firwat?
@lu Ech kucke Filmer op der Tëlee, heiansdo um Laptop, mee ni um Handy, well de Bildschierm ze kleng ass.
@distractor-lu grouss
@distractor-lu Kopfhörer
@en I watch movies on the TV, sometimes on the laptop, but never on the phone, because the screen is too small.
@distractor-en big
@distractor-en headphones

@sentence
@question Lauschtert Dir de Radio?
@lu Nee, ech lauschtere kee Radio, mee ech wëll lëtzebuergesch Podcaste probéieren, wann ech besser schwätzen.
@distractor-lu Videospiller
@distractor-lu dacks
@en No, I do not listen to the radio, but I want to try Luxembourgish podcasts when I speak better.
@distractor-en games
@distractor-en often

@sentence
@question Wat ass Äre Liblingsradiosender zu Lëtzebuerg?
@lu Ech hunn nach kee Liblingssender, well ech de Radio guer net unmaachen.
@distractor-lu Kanal
@distractor-lu Kommentar
@en I do not have a favorite station yet, because I do not switch the radio on at all.
@distractor-en channel
@distractor-en comment

@sentence
@question Wat war dee beschten Uruff, deen Dir jee krut?
@lu Dee beschten Uruff war vun der Bank, well si mir gesot hunn, datt mäi Kredit ugeholl ass.
@distractor-lu Postkaart
@distractor-lu Reklamm
@en The best call was from the bank, because they told me that my loan is accepted.
@distractor-en postcard
@distractor-en advertisement

@sentence
@question Hutt Dir eng Period am Dag, wou Dir net op den Handy kuckt?
@lu Am Dag kucken ech net vill op den Handy, well ech souwéisou virum Laptop schaffen.
@distractor-lu owes
@distractor-lu nuets
@en During the day I do not look at the phone much, because I work in front of the laptop anyway.
@distractor-en evening
@distractor-en night

@sentence
@question Wat ass e gudden Alter, fir de Kanner en Handy ze ginn? Firwat?
@lu Ech mengen, Kanner kënne relativ fréi en Handy kréien, well se domat léiere a spille kënnen.
@distractor-lu spéit
@distractor-lu erwuessen
@en I think children can get a phone relatively early, because they can learn and play with it.
@distractor-en late
@distractor-en adult

@sentence
@question A wéi engem Alter kann een aktiv op sozialen Netzwierker sinn?
@lu Fir sozial Netzwierker sollen d'Kanner erwuesse sinn, villäicht mat siwwenzéng Joer.
@distractor-lu Stonnen
@distractor-lu fréi
@en For social networks the children should be adult, maybe at seventeen years.
@distractor-en hours
@distractor-en early

@sentence
@question Wéi eng Probleemer bréngt den Internet?
@lu Den Internet bréngt ze vill Informatioun a vill Fake News.
@distractor-lu Sécherheet
@distractor-lu Virdeel
@en The internet brings too much information and a lot of fake news.
@distractor-en security
@distractor-en advantage

@sentence
@question Firwat ass dat e Problem?
@lu D'Reputatioun zielt am Internet net méi, an e Fuerscher huet déiselwecht Stëmm wéi een, deen un eng flaach Äerd gleeft.
@distractor-lu Journalist
@distractor-lu Kommentar
@en Reputation does not count on the internet anymore, and a researcher has the same voice as someone who believes in a flat Earth.
@distractor-en journalist
@distractor-en comment

@sentence
@question Wéi kann een de Stress duerch déi nei Medie reduzéieren?
@lu Ech wiele meng Quelle gutt aus a gi mam Hond spadséieren, dacks mat Musek oder mat engem Gespréich mat menger Fra.
@distractor-lu Notifikatioun
@distractor-lu Bildschierm
@en I select my sources well and go walking with the dog, often with music or with a conversation with my wife.
@distractor-en notification
@distractor-en screen

@sentence
@question Wat sinn d'Vir- an Nodeeler vun engem Lëtzebuergesch Online-Cours?
@lu En Online-Cours ass praktesch a modern, mee ech schwätze do net mat anere Leit.
@distractor-lu langweileg
@distractor-lu Passwuert
@en An online course is practical and modern, but I do not talk with other people there.
@distractor-en boring
@distractor-en password

@sentence
@question Benotzt Dir den Handy och fir Lëtzebuergesch ze léieren?
@lu Jo, ech léiere Lëtzebuergesch mat menger App um Handy, well ech kee gudden Online-Cours fonnt hunn.
@distractor-lu Zeitung
@distractor-lu Fotoapparat
@en Yes, I learn Luxembourgish with my app on the phone, because I did not find a good online course.
@distractor-en newspaper
@distractor-en camera

@sentence
@question Wéi war Är Kandheet ouni Handy?
@lu Meng Kandheet war gutt: ech sinn dobausse gespillt an hunn um Computer Spiller gespillt.
@distractor-lu Handy
@distractor-lu Tablet
@en My childhood was good: I played outside and played games on the computer.
@distractor-en phone
@distractor-en tablet

@sentence
@question Säit wéini hutt Dir e Laptop, a firwat benotzt Dir en?
@lu Ech hunn e Laptop säit der Uni, an ech schaffe domat all Dag.
@distractor-lu Fotoapparat
@distractor-lu seelen
@en I have had a laptop since university, and I work with it every day.
@distractor-en camera
@distractor-en rarely

@sentence
@question Wat fir Technologie benotzt Dir fir online anzekafen, a wat kaaft Dir?
@lu Ech kafen online mam Laptop, meeschtens Bicher a Kleeder.
@distractor-lu Fotoapparat
@distractor-lu Toun
@en I shop online with the laptop, mostly books and clothes.
@distractor-en camera
@distractor-en sound

